 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the term of the bracket of the cyclic words ",
 StyleBox["u", "TI"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " in which particle ",
 StyleBox["i", "TI"],
 " of ",
